{
  "_comment": "Decision-engine fixture v1: projected qualifiers from confirmed in-flight benchmarks (issue #3). Rule: docs/mining_system.md §6.3 — qualifier_rate[a,t] = qualifiers[a,t] / active_bundles[a,t]; expected_q[j] = num_bundles[j] * qualifier_rate; expected_addition[c] = sum over confirmed in-flight benchmarks in c; projected_raw_factor[c] = (pool_q + addition) / (network_q + addition), 0 when the denominator sum is 0. Only benchmarks matching §2 'In-flight benchmark' (confirmed precommit, TIG-selected track known, not yet active or terminal) contribute; §6.3 restates 'whose selected algorithm and track are known'. V0 makes no legacy-multiplier, competitor, active-quality, verification, or confidence adjustments. Values are exact fractions; decimals are approximations. All randomness is supplied explicitly in the input.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "multiple_in_flight_flip_selection",
