    {
      "name": "fractional_expected_additions_summed_exactly",
      "description": "Two in-flight benchmarks with non-integer expected qualifiers (35/12 and 4/3) sum to 51/12 = 17/4; the projected factor 29/137 (about 0.2117) narrowly exceeds c702's 0.2, so c702 is selected. Compares must use the exact ratios (or a representation faithful enough for this margin).",
